We just updated FLASHOUT 2 to version 1.2!

The update features small fixes, but most importantly adds 8 completely new music tunes to the in-game music library! Enjoy!

Of course more updates are coming soon and we will address your suggestions in the next update!

Thank you for your support!

[b]Changelog since launch:[/b]
[list]
[*]8 new music tunes added to the in-game music library;
[*]Manual acceleration option added (you can turn it on in the Settings Menu - refer to game manual for more detail); 
[*]FLASHOUT 3D OST with 13 free MP3 music tunes added ("!bonus" folder - refer to game manual for more detail); 
[*]FLASHOUT 2 Wallpapers added ("!bonus" folder - refer to game manual for more detail); 
[*]Achievements bug fixed.
[/list]

